ow  yeah actually we have a nice little  window this year and  actually it's from october 15th to  december  7th and open enrollment is when anybody  over the age of 65  can choose their health care plans or  change their health care plans and it's  a good time to re-evaluate your health  plan at this time  because 2021 is bringing different  things to us  in terms of needs and i think  at this point in time would be great for  seniors to look into medicare advantage  plans  and there we are here partners in  primary care is here to help you  navigate  in that search if you have any questions  i'm sure a lot of people  need to need to actually take their  wellness exams right well actually  wellness exams is something that's very  important a lot of people have been  putting them off because of the covid  situation  and it's a really good time to really  get a good handle on your health  before there's a problem a wellness exam  is just that  we look at preventative things to  prevent you from  needing to go to the hospital for simple  routine things we are offering  telehealth options for the patients you  can come in in person and see us  in person for more information call  partners in primary care at 702-623-3774  or visit seniorfocuslasvegas.com  there's more las vegas now just ahead  we'll be right back
 

